                                                "sense_id": "5caa7cd3-ab0e-3c23-b196-26b5d64b52c3",
                                                "text": "(...) when the day of the departure came, between her two customs of laughing and crying, Miss Sedley was greatly puzzled how to act."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4e6a126-3c65-4c56-ace3-50fb258c20b5",
                                                "sense_id": "5caa7cd3-ab0e-3c23-b196-26b5d64b52c3",
                                                "text": "Once or twice he scratched his head, and stared out of the window with a puzzled frown. And each time, after a brief survey of the other side of Half Moon Street, he turned back again to the breakfast table with a grin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85228595-f642-4893-8f93-fbf5dd01e3ad",
                                                "sense_id": "5caa7cd3-ab0e-3c23-b196-26b5d64b52c3",
                                                "text": "They could not, it was said, keep Scandinavian bogies and the Scriptures separate in their puzzled brains."
                                            }
